+## CAT command coverage (RGO ONE V6)
+
+The following sections cover the **RGO ONE V6** (model 43001) in detail.
+For the RGO ONE V1-V5 (model 43002), see the description above — it uses a subset
+of the TS-480 command set as confirmed on firmware 2.51a.
+
